{"parse": {"title": "FW-02", "pageid": 25756, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FW-01\" title=\"FW-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FW-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/FW-03\" title=\"FW-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.81.E6.B0.B4.E4.BB.8A.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"流水今日\">流水今日</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 流水今日</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Flood of Memories</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1660302</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu3\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>山中之日，果然悠闲自在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>像这般立在枝头，听听风声、叶声、鸟鸣声，岂不比市井喧闹要好得多？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>——你说是么，燕平？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被喊到名字的鸟儿谨慎地往树枝一侧挪了挪，以便将自己纳入叶片的荫蔽下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我不曾往山下去过。市井喧闹之声，比之兽类打闹的喧哗，如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>按你的性子来看，那便是各有其扰人处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>若要我说，人们在坊市中的叫卖与交谈，倒是别有趣味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使是同族，彼此间的性格与喜好也不尽相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在槐树之下驻足细听，便可分辨出鸟鸣的差异。密集而明亮的声音之下，偶尔会掺杂几个单薄的音节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>山下人常有些新奇的创造，学来说不准就能派上用场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>自从得了他们制砖瓦的法子，我们的巢穴就没再让雨水泡散架了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>确实如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>还有让那些竹条、木板发出优美音律的技巧，把说过的话记录下来的涂鸦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>甚至有用于度量四季更替、时间流逝的一套规则，他们称之为“历法”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>本是寻常事物，在他们看来竟又有了其他意味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>用山下人的眼光观察四周，恐怕会觉得天地实在辽阔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>……燕平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>我知道你一向对这些不感兴趣，但我也总觉着，需找个机会将要说的话全说干净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这句话，燕平自树荫下迈步，挪回原来的位置。两只鸟儿站得近，翅膀挤挨着，蓬出几根不安分的羽毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你也要下山了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>这不过也是早晚之事，祝你顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>借你吉言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枝头难得迎来了片刻安静。其中一只鸟儿伸出翅膀，代替树叶投下阴凉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>你不愿下山，是因为不舍这片土地？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我只是……寻不到应当如此的缘由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>唔，也许是时机未到。这样也好，得麻烦你照料大家的巢，还有那堆收集的小物件……我的书本和乐器便托给你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>你是第一个在中原出生的，或许会比迁徙而来的我们更适应这儿的风土吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>我们所习惯的地方太高了。从高空往下望，城、人，都只是灰扑扑的土堆——但若生活其中，大概能真正体会到诗文中所写的繁盛景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>我想，总有一天，你会动身下山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>至少不是近日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>现在谈论这些，实在是为时过早。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>好吧，好吧……你这慢悠悠的性子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-623101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天族人：</div><div>希望我最后是块有用的骨头，别像旁边树上那家伙似的，尽记了些絮絮叨叨的废话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逢着时节更替，山中鸟兽来去频繁，今日树底的足迹，及至明日，往往隐入叶丛，不复再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>溪水与山风倒是不分昼夜，日日奔涌。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>哦，是……我瞧瞧，是燕平啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>这次是谁的骨头？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>很遗憾，没有你的老熟人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>我会把这些家伙都送入族中祠堂，你若好奇，到时自行前去查看即可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>这么些日子过去了，你还是没有下山的打算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>我估摸着，按如今族中的境况，为族人收敛骨骸的职责最后也只能落到你身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-623120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拾骨人：</div><div>你终究还是得去一趟的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>多谢关照，你且去忙吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树下身披宽松织物的鸟儿耸了耸羽翼，朝着远处的檐角飞去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……也算是个休憩的好天气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>山上山下，都在天地方圆之间，有何区别？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>不如趁这阵风，打个盹先。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>族人们存留在祠堂中的骨头那样多，他们所记之事，就算花费几十上百年，也难以彻底了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>何况，有这样漫长的寿命，尽可以琢磨任何感兴趣的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>他人的因果，又与我何干呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我本可以不必下山。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山间的兽群已繁衍数代，溪涧旁的岩石也已被水流冲蚀，打磨平整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯独鸟儿们停驻的槐树兀自舒展着枝叶，始终长青，无论四季。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>许久以来，不曾见有新的同族诞生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>如果我也留在山下，想必无人能够代为捡拾我的骸骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……此地也会被草木覆盖吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>迁徙，追逐人类，学习我们此前不曾了解的文化，终究都无法令族群存续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>正如我所预料，这一切不过徒劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>催促他动身的仅是一个念头，以这片土地上常用的说法，可以被称作灵犀，或是感召。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有族人都熟悉这种体验，每至此刻，他们会收拢羽翼，垂头静默。拾骨人则振翅离去，前往同族最后停留的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>还是早去早回为好。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianfeixiang2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianfeixiang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianfeixiang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>就在附近。离城中尚有一段路，不易被人打扰。这倒方便许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>看样子，他或是曾打算赶回族内……只是略迟了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>也无妨，我可为他代劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对惯于俯瞰地面的鸟儿而言，从错杂的枝叶之间寻到一星白色也并不算太难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此行已有收获，可以放缓扇动羽翼的速度，落至土壤之上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_niaogu2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_niaogu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>又见面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骨头不发一言，披着薄布静静地与他对视。它们像是被随意弃置此处的杂物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像过去交谈时那样，鸟儿们仍旧隔着些许距离。只是这层分隔不再能轻易地跨越。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_niaogu1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_niaogu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_niaogu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一道影子盖住另一道影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我时常会想，是否每任拾骨人都在途中被这些景色吸引，于是不久后，做出同样的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-308411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你们到山下去，帮助他们建城，筑桥，寻觅水源或者给出所谓的谏言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>所欲为何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他并未使用能与骨头对话的神秘术。因此这疑问必然落空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕平垂下头，从头骨上的空洞中能看到几只蚂蚁正努力攀爬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-308413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-308413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-308413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>为了让你们学得的知识得到验证？为了对与自己相似的族类施以援助？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-308414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-308412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-308412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-308412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>还是仅仅无法抵抗欲望？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>影子长久地停留在此处。片刻后，燕平抬起翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>“生则尧、舜，死则腐骨。”现下也没什么可说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>该回山上了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FW-02"}}